%% Kiro-API V3 — deployment on a Linux host
flowchart TB
    subgraph host["Linux host (dev / semi-prod)"]
        subgraph systemd["systemd (Type=notify + WatchdogSec + Restart=on-failure)"]
            SVC["kiro-api serve\n(elastic worker pool)"]
        end
        TRAY["kiro-api-tray\n(optional, read-only:\ndots + copy endpoints)"]
        CLI["operator CLI\nlogin · status · stats · config"]
        CREDS["~/.aws/sso/cache · ~/.kiro\n(single account, shared read)"]
        KCLI["kiro-cli binary"]
        JOURNAL["journald logs"]
    end

    NET["clients on localhost or LAN\n(any bind IP / port)"]

    SVC -->|spawns| KCLI
    SVC -->|reads| CREDS
    SVC -->|logs| JOURNAL
    TRAY -->|GET /stats| SVC
    CLI -->|GET /health /stats /metrics| SVC
    NET -->|HTTP| SVC
    systemd -->|restart on crash / watchdog timeout| SVC
